# ODT template support (experimental, v3.8.0) — afterODTCreation hook
AuvoERechnungOdtErrNoPdfConv = ODT template without PDF conversion: Factur-X requires a PDF, but only the .odt file was produced
AuvoERechnungOdtHintEnable = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice (and install LibreOffice on the server) to convert the ODT to PDF before injection
AuvoERechnungOdtErrNoPdfa = the PDF produced from the ODT template is not PDF/A: LibreOffice then outputs a PDF >= 1.5 (compressed xref table) that the Factur-X injection library cannot read
AuvoERechnungOdtHintEnablePdfa = set MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF = libreoffice + MAIN_ODT_AS_PDFA = 1 to produce a readable, injectable PDF/A-1
AuvoERechnungOdtErrPdfMissing = expected PDF not found next to the ODT template (%s): the LibreOffice conversion probably failed (soffice binary missing or not in PATH)

AuvoERechnungErrMulticurrency = invoice in a foreign currency (%s ≠ company currency %s) — unsupported: the XML would diverge from the visible PDF (documented limitation)
AuvoERechnungErrLocalTax = invoice with local taxes (localtax1/2) — unsupported: EN16931 only represents VAT, the XML total would diverge from the visible PDF total (documented limitation)
AuvoERechnungErrNoDate = invoice has no issue date
AuvoERechnungErrNoThirdparty = buyer third party not found (fetch_thirdparty failed)
AuvoERechnungErrNoMysoc = issuing company ($mysoc) not initialised
AuvoERechnungErrInvalidXml = invalid XML
AuvoERechnungErrBrViolations = EN16931 business rules violated
AuvoERechnungErrTempDir = unable to create a temporary file in %s
AuvoERechnungErrTempWrite = unable to write the temporary XML in %s
AuvoERechnungErrNoExec = the exec() function is disabled on this server
AuvoERechnungErrPhpCliChars = AUVOERECHNUNG_PHP_CLI_PATH contains forbidden characters (expected: alphanumeric path, "/ . _ - : ( ) \" and space)
AuvoERechnungErrPhpCliNotFound = the configured PHP binary cannot be found or is not executable: %s
AuvoERechnungErrInjectFailed = PDF injection failed
