AuvoERechnungWarnSellerName = seller company name missing
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerAddress = seller company address missing
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerZip = seller company zip code missing
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerTown = seller company town missing
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerVAT = intra-community VAT number missing (company)
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerVATInvalid = The company VAT ID field contains "%s", which is not a VAT ID (it must start with the country code, e.g. DE123456789). It is not output as VAT ID (BR-CO-09).
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerSIRET = SIRET/SIREN missing (company) — mandatory BR-FR-10
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerEndpoint = seller electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-13 (BT-34)
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerSIRETLen = the seller SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-30), %s entered — a 9-digit SIREN is rejected by Chorus Pro
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerName = buyer name missing
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerAddress = buyer address missing
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerZip = buyer zip code missing
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerTown = buyer town missing
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerEndpoint = buyer electronic address missing (no SIREN/SIRET, no email) — mandatory BR-FR-12 (BT-49)
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerSIRENRouting = buyer SIREN/SIRET missing — required for routing on the Plateformes Agréées network (endpoint BT-49 schemeID 0225); an email alone is not routable
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerSIRETLen = the buyer SIRET must contain exactly 14 digits (BT-47), %s entered
AuvoERechnungWarnNoBank = no bank account configured in the module
AuvoERechnungWarnNoForceFont = MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT not set — the generated PDF is not guaranteed PDF/A-3 (fonts not embedded); fixable in one click from the AuVo E-Rechnung module setup (diagnostic)
AuvoERechnungWarnPaymentMeansOmitted = payment means %s (credit transfer) omitted from XML: no IBAN configured (BR-61 — configure a bank account in the module)
AuvoERechnungWarnDirectDebitNoICS = SEPA direct debit: creditor ICS missing (BT-90) — set the Dolibarr constant PRELEVEMENT_ICS
AuvoERechnungWarnDirectDebitNoRUM = SEPA direct debit: mandate reference (RUM) missing (BT-89) — fill in the third party's default bank account with its mandate reference
AuvoERechnungWarnCreditNoteNoSource = credit note without a linked source invoice: the reference to the original invoice (BG-3, mandatory French mention) cannot be emitted — create the credit note from the original invoice
AuvoERechnungWarnAllNegativeLines = fully negative invoice that is not a credit note: lines emitted as-is, the XML violates BR-27 (use a Dolibarr credit note)
AuvoERechnungWarnSituationInvoice = situation (progress billing) invoice: emitted as TypeCode 380, but the mapping of cumulative amounts/retentions is not guaranteed compliant (documented limitation)
AuvoERechnungWarnRoundingAdjusted = VAT rounding gap of %s spread on the main category to guarantee BR-CO-14 (check the totals)
AuvoERechnungWarnTaxMismatch = gap of %s between line VAT and the invoice VAT total, not attributable (no taxed category)
AuvoERechnungWarnTaxRecomputed = VAT of category %s recomputed from its basis (%s instead of %s) to satisfy BR-CO-17 — the gap with the Dolibarr total comes from per-line rounding (check the rounding mode)
AuvoERechnungWarnTotalsMismatch = XML grand total (%s) differs from the Dolibarr total (%s) — local taxes or inconsistent lines; the XML favours EN16931 internal consistency (BR-CO-15)
AuvoERechnungWarnVeraPdfNotFound = veraPDF not found or not executable: %s (AUVOERECHNUNG_VERAPDF_PATH)
AuvoERechnungWarnVeraPdfFailed = veraPDF: the generated PDF is not PDF/A-3b compliant (details in syslog) — check MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT and the PDF template images
AuvoERechnungWarnBrPrefix = EN16931 business rule:
AuvoERechnungWarnCorrectiveNoSource = corrective invoice without a linked source invoice: the reference to the replaced invoice (BT-25, required by rule BR-FR-CO-04) cannot be emitted — create the replacement invoice from the original invoice
AuvoERechnungWarnRefTooLong = invoice reference (BT-1) too long: %s characters, maximum 35 (rule BR-FR-01)
AuvoERechnungWarnRefCharset = invoice reference (BT-1) "%s" contains characters that are not allowed — allowed: letters, digits and - + _ / , no space (rule BR-FR-02)
AuvoERechnungWarnSellerSirenSiretMismatch = seller SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the company card
AuvoERechnungWarnBuyerSirenSiretMismatch = buyer SIREN (%s) and SIRET (%s) are inconsistent: the first 9 digits of the SIRET must match the SIREN (rule BR-FR-09) — fix the third-party card
AuvoERechnungWarnVatRateNotFR = VAT rate %s %% is not in the list of allowed French rates, mainland and overseas departments (rule BR-FR-16) — check the input if this rate is not intentional
AuvoERechnungWarnEndpointSuffixCharset = the seller electronic address suffix (AUVOERECHNUNG_ENDPOINT_SUFFIX_SELLER) contains characters that are not allowed — only letters, digits and - _ . are kept when emitting (rule BR-FR-23)
AuvoERechnungWarnEndpointTooLong = seller electronic address is %s characters long: maximum 125 (rule BR-FR-25) — shorten the configured suffix

